      <item>
        <title>🎙️ @StudyFetch made its largest AI inference workload nearly 10x less expensive with NVIDIA Riva, Parakeet ASR and NVIDIA NIM microservices. The gains support voice tutoring, real-time personalization and a new agentic learning platform.</title>
        <dc:creator>@nvidia</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>🎙️ <a href="https://nitter.net/StudyFetch" title="StudyFetch">@StudyFetch</a> made its largest AI inference workload nearly 10x less expensive with NVIDIA Riva, Parakeet ASR and NVIDIA NIM microservices.<br>
<br>
The gains support voice tutoring, real-time personalization and a new agentic learning platform.</p>
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHOlUY3eW8AEuKdF.jpg" style="max-width:250px;" />]]></description>
