      <item>
        <title>To compete in the intelligence era, nations need AI factory infrastructure. Together, @official_naver, NVIDIA, and @Brookfield are expanding Korea’s national AI factory buildout to fuel Korea’s startups and industries at gigawatt-scale. NAVER is deploying the NVIDIA DSX platform to deliver full-stack, lowest-cost AI factory infrastructure.</title>
        <dc:creator>@nvidia</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>To compete in the intelligence era, nations need AI factory infrastructure. <br>
<br>
Together, <a href="https://nitter.net/official_naver" title="NAVER_official">@official_naver</a>, NVIDIA, and <a href="https://nitter.net/Brookfield" title="Brookfield">@Brookfield</a> are expanding Korea’s national AI factory buildout to fuel Korea’s startups and industries at gigawatt-scale. <br>
<br>
NAVER is deploying the NVIDIA DSX platform to deliver full-stack, lowest-cost AI factory infrastructure.</p>
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHODL2jXWQAA7H20.png" style="max-width:250px;" />]]></description>
