      <item>
        <title>SK Group and NVIDIA today announced a $500 billion-plus initiative spanning AI factories and next-generation memory. ➡️ @SKtelecom is building a 2-gigawatt NVIDIA Vera Rubin DSX AI Factory in Korea to serve global compute demand. ➡️ @SKhynix and NVIDIA will codevelop next-generation AI memory, including HBM. Korea is ready to become a global AI powerhouse with world-class networks and data centers, leadership in chip technology and vast industrial scale.</title>
        <dc:creator>@nvidia</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>SK Group and NVIDIA today announced a $500 billion-plus initiative spanning AI factories and next-generation memory.<br>
<br>
➡️ <a href="https://nitter.net/SKtelecom" title="SK telecom">@SKtelecom</a> is building a 2-gigawatt NVIDIA Vera Rubin DSX AI Factory in Korea to serve global compute demand. <br>
➡️ <a href="https://nitter.net/SKhynix" title="SK hynix">@SKhynix</a> and NVIDIA will codevelop next-generation AI memory, including HBM.<br>
<br>
Korea is ready to become a global AI powerhouse with world-class networks and data centers, leadership in chip technology and vast industrial scale.</p>
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHODLfCeaMAAy9_j.jpg" style="max-width:250px;" />]]></description>
